WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Arrival: a task-based English game for A2 to B1 learners

2
00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:11.005
You've just arrived in a new city (fictional Harbour City)

3
00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:13.505
Every cinematic is captioned and skippable (Esc)

4
00:00:13.505 --> 00:00:20.013
Task 1: buy the right transit ticket at the station

5
00:00:20.013 --> 00:00:27.015
Task 2: order lunch for a friend with a nut allergy. Read the menu board first

6
00:00:27.015 --> 00:00:33.018
Task 3: ask a pharmacist for help; Task 4: sort out a hostel booking

7
00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:38.523
Phrasebook with spaced review, saved only on this device

8
00:00:38.524 --> 00:00:44.028
Captions on, speech rate adjustable, speech input off by default

9
00:00:44.028 --> 00:00:49.031
Every task also works in text mode, as a reading path

10
00:00:49.031 --> 00:00:53.034
Free, no account, no tracking: immersive-learning-showcase.vercel.app
